Make be-rust's Promise a std Future, so Rust code can .await Temper promises on any executor.
Upstream: not yet; to offer Kotlin Temper.

Adds wakers beside the waiters, woken on resolve; no bounds of its own,
so a promise is Send exactly when its value type is.

